  "limitations": [
    "ChinaMobile Beijing is an observational proxy with missing slots; daily distance is adjacent observed-slot displacement, not complete daily mileage.",
    "WorldMove has no stable cross-day user identifiers in the released Beijing file.",
    "LifeBench has 300 person-days but only five independent personas, limiting city-level spatial coverage.",
    "CoPB released trajectories contain no stable user/date identifiers; rows are independent generated daily schedules.",
    "CoPB activity-interval gaps are retained as missing slots, so raw temporal metrics also reflect its output coverage; coverage-matched metrics use the CoPB/chinamobile slot intersection.",
    "The CoPB repository contains training/evaluation pipelines for chinamobile; results against this reference are not an independent held-out generalization test."
  ]
}
